Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(825.2,512.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(653,666)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Inside Story!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(653,764)\fnPapyrus\fs60}A Drillmaster for the Swine!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look over there.\NIt's oinky-doink. What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear Ronko Menon just\Njoined their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who got busted 15 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's back working in Akiba? She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a novice maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been going around crushing\Nplaces ever since she joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have ourselves a new war pig, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all created creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what is the\NCreatureland Group's purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To unify the Keeper Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The following three cafes get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxy Vixen Cafe. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devoted Maid Dog Cafe. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are three great attributes\Nevery maid in our group should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is the ability to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another is the ability to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, the most important attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think we wouldn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're embezzling from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take the fall for this, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important attribute to have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loyalty toward the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to enforce these attributes, we\Nwill be sending Drillmasters to each cafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(771.2,505.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Sows, do any of you\Nknow what this cafe is missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool vibes, some\Ncraftiness, kindness, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steadfast resolve, the chief\Ncapable of running a kiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Swine, it's our lack\Nof maid-like activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief is so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've hardly done anything\Nmaid-like since I've come to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The group is sending us a Drillmaster\Nto straighten our asses up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a Drill Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're specialists in teaching\Nmaids how to properly run a cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumors are, most maids get crushed\Nunder their hellish training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they get crushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Drill Master's here,\Nwe're gonna try real hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always try real hard, Chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540.8,694.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(718.4,853)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}The Day Before Training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the pigsty, mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your masters are supposed to\Nwant to come home to a pigsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is just part of our cafe theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a maid cafe, but it's\Nalso a pigsty. Ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Luda what? Oink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the dispatch from the group Sano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single one of you fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place is dirty, the\Ndecorations are half-assed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are all over-reliant\Non your star employee,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even she gets away with stale service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you are so empty-headed\Nyou only know how to snort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above all, you have no\Nloyalty towards the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the sorriest maids I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.76,0:04:49.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(830,539.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go re-educate all useless maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut off any maids you come\Nacross and deem too hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept no failures in\Ntraining our creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your training starts tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pass the test within a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll report to the higher-ups that\Nyou're not a problem and need not be cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A test?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You each will be required to\Nsqueeze out at least 100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, piglets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The benevolent Miss Sano is giving\Nyou one last and final chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get your heads in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You. Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The group is cutting you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The panda two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are a bad influence on the maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are undisciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're rotten apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, more like sickly pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but no, I'm a very healthy piggy boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying this out of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather Creatureland\Ndisown you completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that.\NPlease leave. Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not our chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today and onwards, you will treat\Nme as if I am the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reveille is at 5 a .m. That is all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760.4,859.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day One of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, it's time to get up. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, I'm not that adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.49,0:06:23.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,868.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}5:30 A.M. ~ Morning Assembly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress. I said louder.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(740.6,866.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}7:00 A.M. ~ Job Training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally out of sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do it again! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer yes, Madam Creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all done drawing, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, a kitty cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think so, then draw it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of that poor sweet omelet.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(727.8,865)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}12:00 P.M. ~ Café Opens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One oinky-doink drink combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:06:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, oinky-doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, oinky-doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You. Yes, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your head full of pig slop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That much syrup can't possibly be\Nany good for the master's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying dilute it with more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with the right amount\Nbased on cost, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and comment on\Neach other's weaknesses.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.38,0:07:25.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(633.2,865)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't think of any because\Nyou pigs can't think at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me start for you. Shipon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with that makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not appropriate for the\NCreatureland group. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we at least wear makeup the way we...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This maid cafe is part of\Nthe Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you change your whole appearance,\Nyou won't be passing my test.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.65,0:07:48.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(681.4,869.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}0:00 A.M. ~ Teambuilding Exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that there's more stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect you sows to make a\Ncarving of this in a week.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518.4,352.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that have to\Ndo with being a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get carving, or you'll\Nget even less sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.39,0:08:12.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.6,871.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}2:00 A.M. ~ Bedtime
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I turn out the lights\Nso we can go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, do you think being a maid is\Nabout working for her parent group?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's also an important factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some bamboo leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(774.8,863.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day Two of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize it's morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assembly time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're boycotting that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Creature Land Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want a different drill master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't think it's efficient to be\Ntrained by someone we don't agree with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been given full\Nauthority on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the boss of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boycott.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boycott.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boycott.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please put that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I see it was all done\Nfor your own betterment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose I must have\Ntaken the wrong approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this change in attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me talk to you\Nindividually before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you still decide to kick me\Nout after that, I will comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we can at least listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I wonder what she wants to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, take a good look at the\NCreatureland group building.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(781,158.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, it's really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you know what the\Nrelationship is between the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,group and its maids uh\Nno not really I see them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life I won't\Nlet go of you. No! Move me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our arms represent the relationship\Nbetween the group and its maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how you answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this. Oink! Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it is you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This arm represents the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It protects its maids no\Nmatter how much it gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In return, maids squeeze out\Ntheir honey money for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of supportive\Nrelationship we share together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right! Of course, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She threw me off the damn building. What\Nthe heck, man? That's total crap, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh what the fuck dudes\Nyou know i admit the stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miss sano tells us it's\Nactually pretty decent
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh maybe she's not such\Na bad person after all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i would like to see\Nwhat i can learn from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:12:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her teachings, the Hell!\Nbut we're gonna kick her
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out right guys what if\Nwe see how things go it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might not be that bad\Nreally what about you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ronko i believe it might\Nbe worth the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait are y 'all for real\Nsmells so good oh the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crunchy part of the\Nchicken rice is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally scoring.\NWelcome home. Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allow us to see you all\Nallow us to see you all.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.51,0:12:25.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(794,866.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Day Three of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your work attitude\Ngoing to be for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We work with gratitude for our group!\NYumechi! Yes! Yumechi! Yes! Yumechi! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yumechi! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job squeezing out\Nthe 100,000 for the group!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am glad to have contributed\Nto the Creatureland group!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get complacent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can squeeze out a lot more then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all of you go and serve\Nyour little pig asses off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else? Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.76,0:13:02.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(643.2,875.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Zoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi wasn't insistent enough and her\Nmaster left without ordering anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya, thank you so much\Nfor your great comment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, please do your worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Madam Creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shippon played hooky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She missed today's practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, I don't feel any\Nloyalty toward the group from her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you guys...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(708.8,740.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}SHIIPON
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet! Sweet! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you now see the joy in working\Nfor that sweet honey money?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we start doing our\Nbest for the sake of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deserter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo, sheep on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone makes mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now and then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through here what so you're\Ngonna let me go if that is what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want what? About you are\Nyou going to stay and be a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maid. All I care about is\Nmaking sure I protect this cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:15:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what about you I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just kind of fell into
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the business I've never stuck\Nwith other jobs in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like this one so why was\Nbeing a maid the one thing I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kept doing I get it I had a\Nlot of fun just being a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the oinky-doink I know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, on second thought,\NI still want to be a maid.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(864,605)\fnPapyrus\fs60}tureland
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(757.2,862)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day Four of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, I'll work my heart\Nout for the sake of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look much cuter that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It suits you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for assembly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the hundred thousand\NI made, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure made me wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.02,0:16:41.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,512)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.40,0:16:43.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,855.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Last Day of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to announce the final\Nresults of your maid training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the sorriest bunch\Nof maids I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heads are full of slop, your dues\Nare overdue, and you always avoid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of\Ndespicable maids you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids don't cry that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look at the result of\Nyour teamwork to remind
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourselves that you are maids\Nin the Creatureland group!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Santa! Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much, Instructor Sano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kachimachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tired, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sleepy for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, you know, did I\Nreally do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always get my ass yelled at because\Nthey never earn enough money for me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm getting pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for you sickly pigs to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose to\NYumechi and have her rub
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it in my face that she's\Na better pig than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order a song for me and\NI'll squeal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.56,0:18:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoya, where's Shippan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she went for a\Nstroll a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi, your face doesn't\Nlook too good, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to keep\Nworking on cutting costs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to earn enough honey\Nmoney to pay her dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pig dicks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This shit ends right now! Uh-uh. Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Sheepon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oinky-doink belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret that\Nyou kicked me out on my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, what are you doing? Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the out of your fucking mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, stop her! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiba, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put that down!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416.2,406.4)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That represents the bond between\Nus and instructor Soto! I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what we worked for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sake of the group!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't fucking care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the moments\Nthat are actually fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even in this smelly-ass pig shit town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up, you swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it and come back!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.92,0:19:50.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,400)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.94,0:20:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790.4,852.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}A Few Days Later
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500.8,688)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that damn panda here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okachi-machi! Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy bamboo leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief, you went and ate\Na parfait again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hid one as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Zoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back where they started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you coming or going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, make up your mind already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that won't do. Mistress,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, but there are other masters\Npresent, so could you kindly vacate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you about\Nthat hideous makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look good on you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.26,0:20:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My makeup's the bomb just the\Nway it is, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got some handsome masters\Nin here, so keep it down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, you can't go\Nslapping sheep on like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept no failures in\Ntraining our creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, disowned even.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to see you off, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.16,0:21:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These strokes. Nice. Stop and flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi. Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi Wahira, age 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having loads of fun and\Nlearning a lot as a cute maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shippon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a maid sure is a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally got that right.
